    <p><strong>Minesweeper – Find and Seek</strong> respects your privacy.</p>

    <p>
      This app does not require users to create an account and does not directly
      collect names, email addresses, phone numbers, precise location, or payment
      information from users. However, this app uses third-party services to
      display advertisements and improve app reliability. These third-party
      services may collect, process, and share certain user data as described
      below.
    </p>

    <h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>
    <p>
      The app uses Google AdMob, a third-party advertising service provided by
      Google. Google AdMob may collect and share data including, but not limited to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Device or other identifiers, such as advertising ID and app set ID</li>
      <li>Device information, such as device type, operating system, and IP address</li>
      <li>App interaction data, such as ad views, ad clicks, and app usage events</li>
      <li>Diagnostics and app performance data, such as crash logs and performance information</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This data may be used for advertising or marketing, analytics, fraud
      prevention, security, and compliance purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      Data collected through Google AdMob may be transmitted to Google and its
      service providers. The app developer does not sell users' personal
      information and does not operate an independent user account database.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      Data transmitted by third-party services is transmitted using secure
      transport mechanisms where supported by those services. The app developer
      does not directly store advertising identifiers, app interaction data, or
      diagnostic data on a separate developer-operated server.
    </p>

